WEBVTT

00:00:05.075 --> 00:00:10.871
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:11.121 --> 00:00:16.116
Type "Naira" in the Search box.

00:00:16.366 --> 00:00:21.229
Click Edit Counting Money in Naira.

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:25.338
Click Choose poster.

00:00:25.588 --> 00:00:29.847
Click 0:34 Use this.

00:00:30.097 --> 00:00:35.490
Scroll to Crop and focus.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:41.740
Type "Naira notes and coins on a table."
in the Poster description (alt text) box.

00:00:44.402 --> 00:00:48.253
Click Save poster.

00:00:48.503 --> 00:00:54.503
Wait until you see Before you publish.
